{
  "key": 18331,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hunh?\r",
        "Oh, it's you, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "You finally got here?\f",
        "You're slow like always.\r",
        "But anyway, the Gym Leader's tough!\n",
        "Like, seriously serious!\r",
        "If the Gym Leader's this tough,\n",
        "I wonder how he compares\f",
        "to my dad...\r",
        "...Huh? Forget it.\r",
        "Anyway, the Gym Leader's gone off\n",
        "to the coal mine.\r",
        "If you want to take on the Gym Leader,\n",
        "you'd better go off to the mine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I told you, the Gym\n",
        "Leader went down to the Oreburgh Mine.\r",
        "If you want to take the Gym challenge,\n",
        "you have to go down to the mine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00002",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}Thud!!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whoops! {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "You got the Gym Badge, huh?\r",
        "Eterna City is the next place with\n",
        "a Gym that gives away Badges, right?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "So, yeah, I went to Route 207, but\n",
        "you can’t go there without a Bicycle.\r",
        "I made my team battle and toughened\n",
        "them up, so it wasn’t a waste.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "So, I’m going back to Jubilife City.\n",
        "Next stop, the Eterna Gym Badge!\r",
        "Ten seconds before I dash!\r",
        "Nine...\r",
        "Bah! Who’s got time to count?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, Trainer!\r",
        "Huh? Uh-oh!\n",
        "You don’t have a single Gym Badge?\r",
        "You’d better do something about that!\n",
        "I’ll take you to the Pokémon Gym.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "There’s someone there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that guy in front of the Gym\n",
        "your friend?\r",
        "He’s sort of twitchy and impatient."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hi, you’re back!\n",
        "The Gym Leader’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Can I see your Trainer Case?\r",
        "It’s got the Gym Badge you just\n",
        "won, right?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gym Leader went off to work in\n",
        "the mine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gym Leader is young, but he’s\n",
        "the mine’s safety supervisor.\r",
        "He’s an expert in more than just one\n",
        "field!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone’s proud of the mine.\r",
        "They’re digging for coal under the\n",
        "sea as we speak...\r",
        "It’s amazing how they do it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Up ahead there’s a huge mountain\n",
        "that towers above everything.\r",
        "It divides Sinnoh into two distinct\n",
        "halves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you seen the vents?\n",
        "They release steam from down below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "These vents exchange the hot air\n",
        "down below with the fresh air outside.\r",
        "Looking down them gives me the urge\n",
        "to start yelling into ’em! Hello!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no question. This is hard,\n",
        "hard work.\r",
        "But working alongside Pokémon...\n",
        "It gives me a boost somehow.\r",
        "Here, take one of these.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Feeling hale and hearty puts a smile\n",
        "on my face. And that makes me happy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "This pile of dirty sand is called\n",
        "a slag heap.\r",
        "It’s the waste from sorting coal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Chop, chop, MACHOP!\n",
        "Chop, chop away on rocks! ~♫"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "TMs are single use only, so think\n",
        "it over before you use one.\r",
        "It's tricky trying to decide which\n",
        "Pokémon should learn what moves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "When I run around with my Running\n",
        "Shoes on, I’m the center of attention!\r",
        "...At least that’s what it feels like.\n",
        "There’s always someone looking at me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Natural time capsules buried many,\n",
        "many years ago...\r",
        "That’s what Fossils are."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00024",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Macho! Chopo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00025",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Pigyooh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00026",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Gwooh! Gogogooh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh City\n",
        "City of Energy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Roark\f",
        "“Call me Roark the Rock!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh Mining Museum\n",
        "“Coal Mining and You!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000065_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh Mine\n",
        "Beware of Busy Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_Arc1MinerDeepShaft",
      "en_US": [
        "Something's wrong down in the\n",
        "deep shaft.\r",
        "We hear crying, like a Pokémon\n",
        "in pain. Real faint.\r",
        "Been going on for days.\n",
        "Boss sealed that tunnel off."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_Arc1MinerDarkCoats",
      "en_US": [
        "Saw some folks in dark coats\n",
        "hauling crates up by the old shaft\f",
        "one night.\r",
        "Figured they were surveyors."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_Arc1MinerTunnelGlowing",
      "en_US": [
        "Miner: The sealed tunnel!\n",
        "It's glowing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerMissing",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you seen a Machop?\r",
        "Mine bolted when the ground shook\n",
        "two nights back.\f",
        "Hasn't come back since.\r",
        "He's never run off before.\n",
        "Never."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumReaderFirstBuzz",
      "en_US": [
        "The Portal Reader gave a faint\n",
        "buzz!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerWhatsThatRacket",
      "en_US": [
        "What's that racket?\r",
        "...Your gadget's twitching toward\n",
        "the coal heaps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "The coal heaps, the back streets,\n",
        "the mine...\r",
        "He could be anywhere.\n",
        "Please. Find my Machop."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerDidntAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop?! Is that you?\r",
        "You found him? I didn't even get\n",
        "the chance to ask anyone!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerBigLug",
      "en_US": [
        "MACHOP! You big lug!\n",
        "Where've you been?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerMarkOnHisArm",
      "en_US": [
        "...There's a mark on his arm.\r",
        "Like a splinter worked its\n",
        "way out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerTwoDays",
      "en_US": [
        "Two days stuck in the dark,\n",
        "hurting and scared...\f",
        "and something grew in him?\r",
        "And it went away once he\n",
        "calmed down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerAWeek",
      "en_US": [
        "The fellas in the deep shaft say\n",
        "that crying's been going a week.\r",
        "If two days did that to my\n",
        "Machop...\r",
        "what's a week doing to whatever's\n",
        "behind that seal?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop dug this up.\n",
        "Take it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerBagFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop dug something up for you,\n",
        "but your Bag's full.\r",
        "Come back for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMinerAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "He hasn't left my side since.\r",
        "Whatever's down in that deep\n",
        "shaft... I hope somebody helps it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumMachop",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop: Maaacho!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumKidHideout",
      "en_US": [
        "Grown-ups never come back here.\r",
        "It's the best hideout in Oreburgh!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumKidSawMachop",
      "en_US": [
        "A Machop ran past here crying!\r",
        "It was holding its arm.\n",
        "It went toward the mine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumKidAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "That crying Machop's okay now?\n",
        "Good!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumBuzzFaint",
      "en_US": [
        "The Portal Reader gives a faint\n",
        "buzz..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumBuzzLoud",
      "en_US": [
        "The Portal Reader is buzzing!\n",
        "It's getting stronger."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumBuzzWild",
      "en_US": [
        "BZZZT! The Portal Reader is going\n",
        "wild!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumYardFlecks",
      "en_US": [
        "Violet flecks on the coal,\n",
        "like glitter. They're warm.\r",
        "Scuffed little footprints lead off\n",
        "between the houses."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCity_Text_HumAlleyFlecks",
      "en_US": [
        "More violet flecks, scattered\n",
        "down the alley.\r",
        "They're still warm."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
